From 4e6b1a09cb1852a590219ec61a8e3f4c3bcf5711 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:28:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0150: feed menu. On the map, X in front of the hungry
 partner (facing it within 45 degrees, within its item take distance + 12)
 opens the food of the inventory in the inventory's layout (icon, name,
 amount, two columns, scroll bar past 5 rows, description box):
 ITEM_FUNCTIONS[type] == handleFood. X gives the chosen one as Items > Use
 does (startFeedingItem, INVENTORY_POINTER on its slot), triangle closes; the
 clock stops while it is open. With no food X plays the refusal sound. New
 mod_feed.c, hooked from tamerTickWalkingState after checkMapInteraction
 (NPCs, chests and press tiles take X first)

